# 🍤 Tempora

Detect tempo and beats from audio in real-time using the Web Audio API.

[![NPM Version](https://img.shields.io/npm/v/%40nekopaw%2Ftempora?style=flat)](https://www.npmjs.com/package/%40nekopaw%2Ftempora)
</div>

## Installation

```bash
# if PNPM
pnpm add @nekopaw/tempora

# else if NPM
npm install @nekopaw/tempora

# else if Yarn
yarn add @nekopaw/tempora
```

